WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:10,620
I want to take a trip home

2
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,800
Very soon. I'll take you five minutes.

3
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,320
That's right

4
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:16,870
It's easy for you to go home

5
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,290
Send me back first

6
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,140
Then just drive back by yourself

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,900
How long do you want to stay? How long do you want to stay?

8
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,420
I promised your father to protect you

9
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,100
OK, OK, OK

10
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,100
How do you like it?

11
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,150
I'm too lazy to argue with you anymore

12
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,450
Just wait a moment

13
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,970
Why did you buy these and take them home?

14
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:50,480
You wait in the car for five minutes for me to show you the door. I have something to do down here.

15
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,640
You go home first and I'll wait for you. I'll be right down here.

16
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,280
If you need anything, honk the horn and I'll be right out.

17
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:11,230
Why are you back?

18
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:13,270
Didn't you say you were going to work outside?

19
00:01:13,430 --> 00:01:14,670
Can't you come back in this half year?

20
00:01:15,230 --> 00:01:16,350
I happened to pass by here

21
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:17,550
Drop by to see you

22
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:19,190
I have something to do and will leave soon

23
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,600
I've only been to school for two days

24
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,720
I have a day off today. I have one day at the end of the month.

25
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:24,840
Go back to school tomorrow

26
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,440
This is the fruit and meat I bought for you.

27
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:30,660
Remember, you must eat well

28
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,100
Buy whatever you want to eat

29
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:34,940
If you don't have enough money, call me

30
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,560
I know bro

31
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,540
You buy so much fruit

32
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:39,860
How can I finish eating?

33
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:41,780
Eat even after eating

34
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:48,740
You need to borrow Teacher Su’s mobile phone to look for me in advance and wait for me to pay you the salary.

35
00:01:48,940 --> 00:01:49,940
I’ll buy you another mobile phone

36
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:51,940
You must not save any more money, you know?

37
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,520
Brother, I don’t want money

38
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:57,200
I haven't used the money you gave me last time. Just take it.

39
00:01:57,810 --> 00:01:59,250
You don't have any money on you

40
00:02:00,070 --> 00:02:08,450
Give it all to me. Whatever you use, I still have money. You don’t have to worry about me.

41
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:09,840
take care of yourself

42
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:13,200
If you need anything, call me from a public phone, okay? I'm leaving first.
